      "value": "@{629ad571a782f30b69d2521f|full_name}: Yup! It sure does. If you use those lights for idk, GPU temp or something like that i guess.\nIt's hardly a solution. But it makes it a tiny bit less annoying. The other options are, don't play anything with eac at all, or kill the task in task manager yourself (or run the command yourself in command prompt).\nSo when the others are either extreme or annoying, this isn't a bad solution.",
