      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "**This is not a VRChat bug.** This is an issue with how Asus AURA operates, which apparently disagrees with EAC. Unfortunately, we can't fix this or work around it from our perspective.\nSome newer versions of the AURA software apparently don't have this issue. Try updating it! If that doesn't work, you'll have to uninstall the software, unfortunately.\nSome alternatives exist, such as OpenRGB and Aurora.",
